prompts.plaza:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: Game Boy Color PLAZA DE LA DIGNIDAD environment / hazard metatile atlas.
EXACT square atlas: 4 columns x 4 rows of 16x16 LOGICAL pixel cells = 64x64 native pixels, shown enlarged with nearest-neighbor block pixels. Edge-to-edge, no drawn grid, captions, labels, gutters, or margin. Strict side-on platformer view, chunky 1990s handheld pixel-art shapes. Sixteen independently reusable cells.
Row 1: uniform light lavender dusk sky #c8c0d4; distant Santiago monument and skyline against that sky; stone pavement top with strongly readable flat walkable top edge; stone pavement fill texture.
Row 2: LEFT HALF of a teal public transit bus side; matching RIGHT HALF including front windshield; standalone roof platform / bus rooftop against sky; pair of bus wheels against sky.
Row 3: LEFT HALF of a muted olive-green water cannon truck (guanaco) side; matching RIGHT HALF of cab; small water-cannon nozzle pointing right against sky; red warning beacon against sky.
Row 4: stone monument base / step; simple stone ornament / plinth; pale tear gas cloud against sky; horizontal bright water jet against sky.
Four colors maximum per cell. Palette families:
dusk #c8c0d4 #9894b4 #686888 #38445c;
stone #c8c0d4 #b8b0a0 #78848c #38445c;
bus #c8c0d4 #a8c0ac #58a89c #304c5c;
